{
"text": "Share by Email (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1399362792351330+-+The+Difference+Is+Clear+Day+4%3A+HealthcareThis+year%2C+Mitch+Bolinsky+voted+against+Connecticut+setting+its+own+vaccine+standards+based+on+science+and+trusted+medical+guidance.+Reference%3A+www.cga.ct.gov%2F2026%2FSUM%2FPDF%2F2026SUM00003-R02HB-05044-SUM.PDFPA+26-3+%28HB-5044%29+protects+access+to+recommended+vaccines+by+letting+Connecticut%E2%80%99s+Department+of+Public+Health+set+standards+of+care+for+children+and+adults%2C+informed+by+organizations+like+the+American+Academy+of+Pediatrics%2C+the+American+Academy+of+Family+Physicians%2C+and+others.+It+also+helps+protect+insurance+coverage%2C+expands+access+for+uninsured+and+underinsured+adults%2C+and+allows+Connecticut+to+secure+vaccines+if+federal+access+is+disrupted.+At+a+time+when+the+federal+government+is+putting+vaccine+access+at+risk%2C+Connecticut+needs+leaders+who+will+protect+affordable+health+care+and+keep+families+healthy.Michelle+Embree+Ku+will+vote+to+protect+vaccine+access.+And%2C+that%E2%80%99s+the+difference%21Michelle+Embree+Ku+Democrat+for+State+Representative%2C+106th+District#TheDifferenceIsClear #CTPolitics #Healthcare #VaccineAccess #Connecticut #lookitup #science"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F902281863260413_1397967425824200+-+Proud+to+receive+an+A+grade+from+CT+Against+Gun+Violence+for+standing+up+for+common-sense+gun+violence+prevention.This+recognition+reflects+a+clear+commitment%3A+keeping+families+safe%2C+supporting+responsible+gun-safety+policies%2C+and+treating+gun+violence+as+the+public-safety+crisis+it+is.This+work+can%E2%80%99t+wait%E2%80%94and+I%E2%80%99ll+keep+fighting+for+safer+schools%2C+safer+neighborhoods%2C+and+a+Connecticut+where+every+family+can+live+without+fear.Michelle+Embree+Ku+Democrat+for+State+Representative%2C+106th+District#election #newtownct #Connecticut #vote #safety"
