"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1398454602442149&title=%09The+Difference+Is+Clear+Day+3%3A+TrafficAnyone+who+drives+I-84+through+Danbury+and+Newtown+knows+the+backups+aren%E2%80%99t+just+frustrating+%E2%80%94+they+affect+safety%2C+commutes%2C+and+our+quality+of+life.This+year%2C+Mitch+Bolinsky+voted+against+PA+26-63%2C+a+bill+that+includes+the+I-84+flex+lane+project+to+help+reduce+congestion+in+the+Danbury+area.+The+bill+also+included+stronger+distracted-driving+measures+and+more+frequent+background+checks+for+Uber+and+Lyft+drivers.Michelle+Embree+Ku+will+support+practical+transportation+investments+and+safety+measures+that+help+prevent+accidents%2C+reduce+traffic%2C+and+keep+Newtown+moving.Sitting+in+traffic+isn%E2%80%99t+partisan.+Finding+solutions+shouldn%E2%80%99t+be+either.+%5Bwww.cga.ct.gov%2F2026%2FVOTE%2FH%2FPDF%2F2026HV-00131-R00HB05464-HV.PDF%5DMichelle+Embree+Ku+Democrat+for+State+Representative%2C+106th+District%23TheDifferenceIsClear+%23NewtownCT+%23I84+%23TrafficSafety+%23ConnecticutPolitics+%23MichelleEmbreeKu+%23lookitup+%09%09"
},
