},
{
"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1399362792351330&title=%09The+Difference+Is+Clear+Day+4%3A+HealthcareThis+year%2C+Mitch+Bolinsky+voted+against+Connecticut+setting+its+own+vaccine+standards+based+on+science+and+trusted+medical+guidance.+Reference%3A+www.cga.ct.gov%2F2026%2FSUM%2FPDF%2F2026SUM00003-R02HB-05044-SUM.PDFPA+26-3+%28HB-5044%29+protects+access+to+recommended+vaccines+by+letting+Connecticut%E2%80%99s+Department+of+Public+Health+set+standards+of+care+for+children+and+adults%2C+informed+by+organizations+like+the+American+Academy+of+Pediatrics%2C+the+American+Academy+of+Family+Physicians%2C+and+others.+It+also+helps+protect+insurance+coverage%2C+expands+access+for+uninsured+and+underinsured+adults%2C+and+allows+Connecticut+to+secure+vaccines+if+federal+access+is+disrupted.+At+a+time+when+the+federal+government+is+putting+vaccine+access+at+risk%2C+Connecticut+needs+leaders+who+will+protect+affordable+health+care+and+keep+families+healthy.Michelle+Embree+Ku+will+vote+to+protect+vaccine+access.+And%2C+that%E2%80%99s+the+difference%21Michelle+Embree+Ku+Democrat+for+State+Representative%2C+106th+District%23TheDifferenceIsClear+%23CTPolitics+%23Healthcare+%23VaccineAccess+%23Connecticut+%23lookitup+%23science+%09%09"
},
{
"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F902281863260413_1397967425824200&title=%09Proud+to+receive+an+A+grade+from+CT+Against+Gun+Violence+for+standing+up+for+common-sense+gun+violence+prevention.This+recognition+reflects+a+clear+commitment%3A+keeping+families+safe%2C+supporting+responsible+gun-safety+policies%2C+and+treating+gun+violence+as+the+public-safety+crisis+it+is.This+work+can%E2%80%99t+wait%E2%80%94and+I%E2%80%99ll+keep+fighting+for+safer+schools%2C+safer+neighborhoods%2C+and+a+Connecticut+where+every+family+can+live+without+fear.Michelle+Embree+Ku+Democrat+for+State+Representative%2C+106th+District%23election+%23newtownct+%23Connecticut+%23vote+%23safety+%09%09"
},
{
"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F902281863260413_1399580532329556&title=%09On+Saturday+night%2C+using+the+cover+of+darkness+and+masks%2C+about+a+dozen+men+stood+outside+Danbury+police+headquarters+holding+a+banner+that+read%2C+%E2%80%9CKeep+New+England+White.%E2%80%9DThis+racism+and+hate+cannot+go+unanswered.I+grew+up+in+Evanston%2C+Illinois%2C+a+community+much+like+Danbury+in+its+diversity.+In+our+neighboring+community+of+Skokie%2C+many+Holocaust+survivors+had+rebuilt+their+lives.+In+the+late+1970s%2C+neo-Nazis+sought+to+march+through+Skokie.+The+ensuing+legal+battle+ultimately+affirmed+their+First+Amendment+rights%2C+but+the+march+itself+never+took+place.+Instead%2C+the+threat+of+that+march+galvanized+Holocaust+survivors%2C+neighbors%2C+and+faith+leaders+to+stand+together+against+hatred+and+intimidation.That+important+lesson+has+stayed+with+me.Danbury%2C+and+every+city%2C+deserves+the+same+response.+We+cannot+answer+hatred+by+pretending+it+isn%26%23039%3Bt+there%2C+and+we+cannot+answer+it+by+abandoning+the+principles+that+protect+everyone%26%23039%3Bs+right+to+speak.+We+answer+it+by+standing+together+and+making+clear+that+intimidation+and+bigotry+do+not+represent+who+we+are.I+grew+up+in+a+community+committed+to+inclusion%2C+but+racism%2C+prejudice%2C+and+stereotyping+existed+there%2C+as+they+do+everywhere.+I+learned+early+that+this+is+a+fight+worth+fighting.+I%26%23039%3Bve+also+always+known+that+I+was+fortunate+to+be+born+in+this+country.+I+didn%E2%80%99t+earn+the+circumstances+of+my+birth%2C+and+I+don%26%23039%3Bt+believe+anyone+should+be+judged%E2%80%94or+treated+as+more+or+less+American%E2%80%94because+of+where+they%2C+their+parents%2C+or+earlier+generations+were+born.Danbury+is+our+neighbor%2C+and+its+diversity+is+one+of+its+strengths.+It%E2%80%99s+part+of+what+makes+our+community%2C+our+region%2C+and+our+country+strong.We+must+never+be+silent+when+people+are+targeted+for+who+they+are+or+where+they+come+from.And%2C+we+must+not+let+a+handful+of+people+who+want+to+divide+us%2C+convince+us+that+they+speak+for+New+England.They+do+not.%23antiracism+%23StandTogether+%23communityfirst+%23community+%23speakout+%09%09"
},
